  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "opening",
      "index": "01",
      "title": "翻开故事书",
      "heading": "守株待兔",
      "visual": "book",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 449,
      "durationSeconds": 14.966666666666667,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "opening-0-8ffdfc396c.m4a",
          "text": "你好，我是小禾。今天，一起听一个守株待兔的故事。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 135,
          "durationSeconds": 4.48
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "opening-1-cd80093226.m4a",
          "text": "守株待兔。株，就是田里的树桩。树桩旁，到底在等谁呢？",
          "startFrame": 173,
          "durationInFrames": 204,
          "durationSeconds": 6.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field",
      "index": "02",
      "title": "勤劳的农夫",
      "heading": "一分耕耘",
      "visual": "field",
      "startFrame": 449,
      "durationInFrames": 375,
      "durationSeconds": 12.5,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "field-0-52aa7f0794.m4a",
          "text": "很久以前，有一位农夫，每天在田里辛苦耕作。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 123,
          "durationSeconds": 4.08
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "field-1-ce88dbba23.m4a",
          "text": "锄地、浇水、除杂草，样样活儿都做得认认真真。",
          "startFrame": 161,
          "durationInFrames": 142,
          "durationSeconds": 4.72
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hare",
      "index": "03",
      "title": "飞来的野兔",
      "heading": "砰的一声",
      "visual": "hare",
      "startFrame": 824,
      "durationInFrames": 384,
      "durationSeconds": 12.8,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "hare-0-e2054bb00a.m4a",
          "text": "忽然，一只野兔飞快地跑来，一头撞在了树桩上。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 137,
          "durationSeconds": 4.56
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "hare-1-6e7fef4d91.m4a",
          "text": "哎哟！野兔撞晕了，躺在地上，一动也不动。",
          "startFrame": 175,
          "durationInFrames": 137,
          "durationSeconds": 4.56
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "luck",
      "index": "04",
      "title": "白捡的兔子",
      "heading": "天上掉馅饼",
      "visual": "luck",
      "startFrame": 1208,
      "durationInFrames": 356,
      "durationSeconds": 11.866666666666667,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "luck-0-1b6b429039.m4a",
          "text": "农夫跑过去，轻轻松松，就捡到了一只大肥兔。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 118,
          "durationSeconds": 3.92
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "luck-1-0f1ef82299.m4a",
          "text": "晚上，他美美地吃了一顿兔肉，心里乐开了花。",
          "startFrame": 156,
          "durationInFrames": 128,
          "durationSeconds": 4.24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "waiting",
      "index": "05",
      "title": "守着树桩的人",
      "heading": "不用干活了？",
      "visual": "waiting",
      "startFrame": 1564,
      "durationInFrames": 418,
      "durationSeconds": 13.933333333333334,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "waiting-0-63207b6e42.m4a",
          "text": "农夫想：种田多累呀。守着树桩，就有兔子送上门，多好！",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 183,
          "durationSeconds": 6.08
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "waiting-1-1d1f08831a.m4a",
          "text": "从第二天起，他扔下锄头，天天坐在树桩旁边等。",
          "startFrame": 221,
          "durationInFrames": 125,
          "durationSeconds": 4.16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "index": "06",
      "title": "荒芜的田地",
      "heading": "什么也没等到",
      "visual": "empty",
      "startFrame": 1982,
      "durationInFrames": 392,
      "durationSeconds": 13.066666666666666,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "empty-0-2f31ffa864.m4a",
          "text": "一天，两天，许多天过去了，再也没有野兔撞上来。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 140,
          "durationSeconds": 4.64
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "empty-1-b81459175d.m4a",
          "text": "田里的庄稼枯了，长满了杂草，农夫什么也没有等到。",
          "startFrame": 178,
          "durationInFrames": 142,
          "durationSeconds": 4.72
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "index": "07",
      "title": "小禾的笔记",
      "heading": "运气与耕耘",
      "visual": "lesson",
      "startFrame": 2374,
      "durationInFrames": 361,
      "durationSeconds": 12.033333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "lesson-0-4a283bb364.m4a",
          "text": "偶尔的好运气，不会天天都来敲门。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 92,
          "durationSeconds": 3.04
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "lesson-1-9343bcd8c2.m4a",
          "text": "真正的收获，要靠自己一天一天，踏踏实实地耕耘。",
          "startFrame": 130,
          "durationInFrames": 159,
          "durationSeconds": 5.28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "index": "08",
      "title": "轮到你想一想",
      "heading": "你会怎么做",
      "visual": "ending",
      "startFrame": 2735,
      "durationInFrames": 305,
      "durationSeconds": 10.166666666666666,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "ending-0-5005a9e526.m4a",
          "text": "如果是你，会怎么劝这位农夫呢？",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 82,
          "durationSeconds": 2.72
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "ending-1-3f30dc7afe.m4a",
          "text": "守株待兔，你学会了吗？我们下集，再见啦。",
          "startFrame": 120,
          "durationInFrames": 113,
          "durationSeconds": 3.76
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
